            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: [1; 1; \u2212 1]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: [1; 1; \u2212 1]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Then we can calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: {A}+{B}-{C}]</span> by performing the operations on each corresponding entry, as follows:</p>",
            "readable_text": "Then we can calculate [MATH: {A}+{B}-{C}] by performing the operations on each corresponding entry, as follows:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: A + B \u2212 C|= [1; 1; \u2212 1] + [\u2212 1; 2; 0] \u2212 [0; 5; \u2212 2]; = [1 + (\u2212 1) \u2212 0; 1 + 2 \u2212 5; \u2212 1 + 0 \u2212 (\u2212 2)]; = [0; \u2212 2; 1]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: A + B \u2212 C|= [1; 1; \u2212 1] + [\u2212 1; 2; 0] \u2212 [0; 5; \u2212 2]; = [1 + (\u2212 1) \u2212 0; 1 + 2 \u2212 5; \u2212 1 + 0 \u2212 (\u2212 2)]; = [0; \u2212 2; 1]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nIf we want to add (or subtract) three or more matrices, all operations should be done elementwise. For example, suppose\n\nContent:\n[MATH: [1; 1; \u2212 1]]\n\nContent:\nThen we can calculate [MATH: {A}+{B}-{C}] by performing the operations on each corresponding entry, as follows:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: A + B \u2212 C|= [1; 1; \u2212 1] + [\u2212 1; 2; 0] \u2212 [0; 5; \u2212 2]; = [1 + (\u2212 1) \u2212 0; 1 + 2 \u2212 5; \u2212 1 + 0 \u2212 (\u2212 2)]; = [0; \u2212 2; 1]]"
      },
      {
