        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: A-(B-C),]</span> where</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: A-(B-C),] where\n\n[MATH: [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: A \u2212 (B \u2212 C)|= [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2] \u2212 ([\u2212 1|\u2212 1; 2|0] \u2212 [0|\u2212 5; 1|1]); = [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2] \u2212 [\u2212 1 \u2212 0|\u2212 1 \u2212 (\u2212 5); 2 \u2212 1|0 \u2212 1]; = [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2] \u2212 [\u2212 1|4; 1|\u2212 1]; = [\u2212 1 \u2212 (\u2212 1)|0 \u2212 4; 2 \u2212 1|\u2212 2 \u2212 (\u2212 1)]; = [0|\u2212 4; 1|\u2212 1]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n[MATH: A \u2212 (B \u2212 C)|= [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2] \u2212 ([\u2212 1|\u2212 1; 2|0] \u2212 [0|\u2212 5; 1|1]); = [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2] \u2212 [\u2212 1 \u2212 0|\u2212 1 \u2212 (\u2212 5); 2 \u2212 1|0 \u2212 1]; = [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2] \u2212 [\u2212 1|4; 1|\u2212 1]; = [\u2212 1 \u2212 (\u2212 1)|0 \u2212 4; 2 \u2212 1|\u2212 2 \u2212 (\u2212 1)]; = [0|\u2212 4; 1|\u2212 1]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: A-(B-C),] where\n\n[MATH: [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2]]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nPerforming the operations on each corresponding entry, we get:\n\n[MATH: A \u2212 (B \u2212 C)|= [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2] \u2212 ([\u2212 1|\u2212 1; 2|0] \u2212 [0|\u2212 5; 1|1]); = [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2] \u2212 [\u2212 1 \u2212 0|\u2212 1 \u2212 (\u2212 5); 2 \u2212 1|0 \u2212 1]; = [\u2212 1|0; 2|\u2212 2] \u2212 [\u2212 1|4; 1|\u2212 1]; = [\u2212 1 \u2212 (\u2212 1)|0 \u2212 4; 2 \u2212 1|\u2212 2 \u2212 (\u2212 1)]; = [0|\u2212 4; 1|\u2212 1]]"
      },
